1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,560
Hari kedua berada

2
00:00:04,370 --> 00:00:06,510
di Makkah, Rasulullah SAW

3
00:00:06,510 --> 00:00:08,160
menyampaikan khutbahnya.

4
00:00:08,360 --> 00:00:09,490
Setelah memuji dan menyebut

5
00:00:09,490 --> 00:00:12,080
kebesaran Allah dan kemuliaan-Nya,

6
00:00:12,080 --> 00:00:13,470
maka baginda bersabda kepada orang

7
00:00:13,470 --> 00:00:16,070
ramai: Inna hazal balada

8
00:00:16,070 --> 00:00:18,490
harramahullahu yauma khalaqas

9
00:00:18,490 --> 00:00:21,550
samawati wal ardh, fa huwa haramun

10
00:00:21,550 --> 00:00:24,380
bi hurmatillahi ila yaumil qiyamah.

11
00:00:24,380 --> 00:00:26,480
Sesungguhnya Allah telah

12
00:00:26,480 --> 00:00:28,910
mengharamkan Makkah, haram melakukan

13
00:00:28,910 --> 00:00:31,750
beberapa perkara di kawasannya sejak

14
00:00:31,750 --> 00:00:34,100
Dia menciptakan langit dan bumi.

15
00:00:34,100 --> 00:00:36,370
Maka negeri ini menjadi tanah haram

16
00:00:36,370 --> 00:00:38,690
dengan keharaman daripada Allah

17
00:00:38,690 --> 00:00:40,060
hingga hari kiamat.

18
00:00:40,060 --> 00:00:42,790
Inna Makkata harramahallahu

19
00:00:43,350 --> 00:00:45,210
wa lam yuharrimhan

20
00:00:45,741 --> 00:00:46,370
nas.

21
00:00:46,370 --> 00:00:49,920
Fala yahillu limri'in yu'minu

22
00:00:49,920 --> 00:00:53,850
billahi wal yaumil akhir an yasfika

23
00:00:53,850 --> 00:00:59,210
biha daman wa la ya'dhida biha syajaratan.

24
00:01:00,460 --> 00:01:04,086
Fa in ahadun tarakhkhasa li qitali

25
00:01:04,086 --> 00:01:05,270
Rasulillah,

26
00:01:05,920 --> 00:01:10,350
fa qulu lahu innallaha azina li Rasulihi

27
00:01:11,220 --> 00:01:13,200
wa lam ya'zan lakum.

28
00:01:13,200 --> 00:01:16,860
Wa innama azina li sa'atan min

29
00:01:16,860 --> 00:01:20,269
naharin, wa qad 'adat hurmatuhal

30
00:01:20,269 --> 00:01:23,280
yauma, hurmatuhal yauma ka hurmatiha

31
00:01:23,280 --> 00:01:27,700
bil ams, wal yuballighis syahidul gha'ib.

32
00:01:27,700 --> 00:01:29,520
Sesungguhnya Allah telah

33
00:01:29,520 --> 00:01:32,410
mengharamkan Makkah, manusia tidak

34
00:01:32,410 --> 00:01:33,460
mengharamkannya.

35
00:01:33,460 --> 00:01:35,230
Maka tidak halal bagi seorang yang

36
00:01:35,230 --> 00:01:36,770
beriman kepada Allah dan hari

37
00:01:36,770 --> 00:01:39,900
akhirat menumpahkan darah di kawasannya.

38
00:01:39,900 --> 00:01:44,500
Jadi negeri Makkah ini negeri yang aman.
